values.content:
=Create a detailed chapter plan for this nonfiction book.

Book Title: {{ $('store the basic information about your book').item.json.book_title }}
Subtitle: {{ $('store the basic information about your book').item.json.subtitle }}
Target Audience: {{ $('store the basic information about your book').item.json.audience }}
Genre: {{ $('store the basic information about your book').item.json.genre }}

Create 10 chapters.

For each chapter provide:
1. Chapter number
2. Chapter title
3. Short description of what the chapter will cover

Return the chapter plan in a clear numbered format.

Do not write the full chapters yet.

parameters.jsCode:
const text = $input.first().json.content.parts[0].text;

const chapters = text
  .split(/(?=###\s+\*\*Chapter\s+\d+:)/)
  .map(chapter => chapter.trim())
  .filter(chapter => chapter.startsWith("### **Chapter"));

return chapters.map((chapter, index) => ({
  json: {
    chapter_number: index + 1,
    chapter_plan: chapter
  }
}));
